WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:01,590
sorry

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:03,590
I seem to have done bad things with good intentions

3
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:06,850
There is a car dealership nearby

4
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,850
You should be able to find tires and repair tools

5
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,250
I'll take you there

6
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:18,100
what are you

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,700
loss of consciousness

8
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,940
you can understand

9
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,140
But can't speak yet

10
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:30,250
Don't go that way

11
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:33,930
Everything is lost there

12
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:36,330
Go directly and you will be discovered. Follow me.

13
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:37,730
There is a safe passage here

14
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:38,730
Thank you sister
